      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm sorry, I don't understand what you mean by a \"goblin flag\" or a \"goblin audit.\" That isn't a standard accounting term. Can we please stick to professional auditing terminology? \n\nI'm looking for actual, practical steps. Could you instead suggest how I might use a data sampling technique, like stratified sampling, to look at these specific small-value transactions? I need a serious methodology for my report.",
